SOURCE PROBLEM
--------------
https://epoch.ai/frontiermath/open-problems/class-group-rank

The grammar is

  ell|r|D|a1,b1,c1|...|ar,br,cr

where -D is fundamental and the primitive positive-definite forms of
discriminant -D must be independent elements of exact order ell.

SOFTWARE AUDIT
--------------

Installed initially:

  python-flint 0.9.0       (no qfb / binary-form class exposed)
  SymPy 1.9

Not installed initially:

  PARI/GP
  cypari2
  Sage

The Ubuntu pari-gp package can be extracted without a system install:

  classrank_pari_tmp=$(mktemp -d /tmp/pari-gp-local.XXXXXX)
  cd "$classrank_pari_tmp"
  apt-get download pari-gp
  dpkg-deb -x pari-gp_*.deb root
  classrank_gp="$classrank_pari_tmp/root/usr/bin/gp"

The committed verifier does not need PARI for class arithmetic.  It uses
python-flint only to factor the square-free core (with a SymPy fallback).
Search and the optional independent audit require the gp executable.

POSITIVE CONTROL
----------------

Command:

  python3 04-computation/imaginary_quadratic_class_rank_certificate_tool_20260824.py \
    verify --pari-gp "$classrank_gp" \
    '3|3|4447704|390,-96,2857|921,-786,1375|346,-68,3217'

Output:

  PURE_PYTHON_VERIFY=PASS|ell=3|r=3|D=4447704|squarefree_core_factors=[(2, 1), (3, 1), (47, 1), (3943, 1)]|mitm_halves=3,9
  REDUCED_FORMS=390,-96,2857|921,-786,1375|346,-68,3217
  PARI_AUDIT=PASS|h=864|cyc=[24, 6, 6]|ell_rank=3|halves=3,9

Thus the field class group is Z/24 + Z/6 + Z/6.  Each displayed form cubes
to the principal form, and the only relation in {0,1,2}^3 is (0,0,0).

