The rank-eight point is violently isolated in this cheap hostile: all twelve
other rows have rank 0, 1, or 3.  In particular, multiplying the record
discriminant by five small ramified primes and taking six nearby fundamental
discriminants does not preserve its large 3-primary subgroup.

